{
    "title": "Royal Cooking - Cooking games",
    "description": "This casual mobile game is also a cooking game!\r\nEnjoy cooking mania and fever, get ready to make food and open a restaurant or don't forget to work in a crazy kitchen! Are you ready for the madness of the crazy kitchen?\r\n\r\nDo you love time management games, diner dash, and cooking? Or are you looking for a different food gameplay among the star chef, kitchen scramble, cook off and cake mania?\r\nIf so, this crazy kitchen is totally for you. You can be a creator of your own restaurant story and open a family style cafe or diner. Immerse yourself into the mania and fever of making food!\r\n\r\nThis restaurant game teaches you to make food & cook delicious burgers, good and great pizza and other popular street foods. Join this crazy kitchen with time management gameplay and simulation fun.\r\n\r\nThe Royal Cooking game is one of the most interesting restaurant games. Experience the fun of time management!\r\n\r\nComplete a diner dash before they leave the diner! Record your own restaurant story!\r\n\r\n FEATURES:\r\n - Enjoy gameplay, classic casual and time management games.\r\n- Unlock advanced diaries, make food and become a star chef with mania and fever.\r\n- Hundreds of fun levels: you need to cook good and great pizza, burgers, and sweet baked goods.\r\n- Get combo streaks to earn big rewards.\r\n- Upgrade your crazy kitchen equipment to become the star chef of mania and fever.\r\n- Use powerful boosters to have more fun!\r\n\r\nYou can find the answers to many questions by contacting our in-game support team. The FAQ is available here: \r\nhttps://matryoshka.helpshift.com/hc/en/8-cookinglive/\r\n\r\nReach out to us regarding any questions or suggestions you have. We read all the messages!\r\n\r\nSubscribe to our social media pages to stay up to date on the latest news and to get useful tips for the game: \r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/matryoshkagamescom\r\n\r\nSincerely, the Matryoshka Games team",
    "descriptionHTML": "This casual mobile game is also a cooking game!<br>Enjoy cooking mania and fever, get ready to make food and open a restaurant or don&#39;t forget to work in a crazy kitchen! Are you ready for the madness of the crazy kitchen?<br><br>Do you love time management games, diner dash, and cooking? Or are you looking for a different food gameplay among the star chef, kitchen scramble, cook off and cake mania?<br>If so, this crazy kitchen is totally for you. You can be a creator of your own restaurant story and open a family style cafe or diner. Immerse yourself into the mania and fever of making food!<br><br>This restaurant game teaches you to make food &amp; cook delicious burgers, good and great pizza and other popular street foods. Join this crazy kitchen with time management gameplay and simulation fun.<br><br>The Royal Cooking game is one of the most interesting restaurant games. Experience the fun of time management!<br><br>Complete a diner dash before they leave the diner! Record your own restaurant story!<br><br> FEATURES:<br> - Enjoy gameplay, classic casual and time management games.<br>- Unlock advanced diaries, make food and become a star chef with mania and fever.<br>- Hundreds of fun levels: you need to cook good and great pizza, burgers, and sweet baked goods.<br>- Get combo streaks to earn big rewards.<br>- Upgrade your crazy kitchen equipment to become the star chef of mania and fever.<br>- Use powerful boosters to have more fun!<br><br>You can find the answers to many questions by contacting our in-game support team. The FAQ is available here: <br>https://matryoshka.helpshift.com/hc/en/8-cookinglive/<br><br>Reach out to us regarding any questions or suggestions you have. We read all the messages!<br><br>Subscribe to our social media pages to stay up to date on the latest news and to get useful tips for the game: <br>https://www.facebook.com/matryoshkagamescom<br><br>Sincerely, the Matryoshka Games team",
    "summary": "Create your restaurant story & make food on a crazy kitchen in this cooking game",
